+# These are used by api/check-analysis.js and must NEVER be prefixed with
+# VITE_ — a VITE_ prefix causes Vite to inline the value into the client
+# bundle, which would expose it to every visitor.
+#
+# Groq API key, used server-side to run the forensic audit LLM call.
