+#
+# Supabase service role key, used server-side to verify a caller's session
+# token before running an audit. Find this in Supabase > Project Settings >
+# API > service_role key. Keep this secret — it bypasses RLS.
+SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key
